                    </ref>, <hi rendition="#italic">General Report</hi>, and <ref
                        target="frus1947v02">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>
                    </ref>, <hi rendition="#italic">Technical Reports, July-September 1947</hi>,
                    Department of State publications 2930, 2952, (Washington, Government Printing
                    Office, 1947).</p>
            </note>
